    {"arborec", "BEGINNER-FRIENDLY", "Wide ground game, Production, Defensive", "The Arborec are a slow, sprawling forest. Infantry grow on their own every round through Mitosis, every infantry and mech has PRODUCTION, and the flagship can build a whole fleet wherever it parks."},
